OL,3,GNEWSASpeeding driver jailed after
OL,4,Akilling cyclist
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for 12 years over
OL,7,Fa fatal crash in which he struck a
OL,8,Fcyclist while driving at more than
OL,9,Fdouble the 30mph speed limit.
OL,11,FJayden Adams, 27, of Ward End,
OL,12,FBirmingham, hit Thomas Brown on Heath
OL,13,FWay in the Hodge Hill area of the city
OL,14,Fon 26 April 2025.
OL,16,FBrown, a 29-year-old father of one,
OL,17,Fsuffered fatal injuries and died in
OL,18,Fhospital three days later, police said.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
