OL,3,GNEWSASpeeding driver jailed after
OL,4,Akilling cyclist
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdams, who drove off after the crash
OL,7,Fand initially told officers he was a
OL,8,Fpassenger in the Seat Leon involved,
OL,9,Fwas jailed at Birmingham Crown Court
OL,10,Fafter previously admitting causing
OL,11,Fdeath by dangerous driving and other
OL,12,Foffences.
